# Pal Park gate, empty GBA slot, no migrated stock.
#
# The worker is at (7, 11). VAR_PAL_PARK_LOBBY_STATE skips Oak's first-
# visit scene so the conversation is the gate, not the gift. The talked
# flag skips the first-time manual and goes straight to Enter / Info /
# Exit; Enter then hits GoToIfNotEnoughMonForCatchingShow. An empty
# slot-2 cannot have stocked six mons, so the console refuses.

name PARKER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 20481
money 3000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_TURTWIG
var VAR_PAL_PARK_LOBBY_STATE 1
flag FLAG_TALKED_TO_PAL_PARK_LOBBY_RECEPTIONIST
party SPECIES_TURTWIG 15 ITEM_NONE
map MAP_HEADER_PAL_PARK_LOBBY 7 12 FACE_UP
